D6 = add('D041-r005', 'unresolved_legal_evidence_D041_5', 'logic.coverage.all[1]', None, 'resolved', 'Effective March 30, 2020, through January 31, 2024, rent increases are prohibited for rental units subject to the Rent Stabilization Ordinance (RSO).', 'Redundant: Zeitraum 2020-03-30 bis 2024-01-31 steht bereits als gte/lte-Leaves in Coverage. Leaf ersatzlos streichen.')
