D9 = add('D041-r009', 'unresolved_legal_evidence_D041_9', 'logic.coverage.all[1]', None, 'resolved', 'A $3.00 surcharge may be added to the rent for the installation and cost of a hard-wired smoke detector or a combination smoke/carbon monoxide detector.', 'Redundant: smoke_detector_installed steht bereits in Coverage und traegt die Textbedingung (Umbruch smoke/carbon im Korpus normalisiert). Leaf streichen.')
D10 = add('D041-r010', 'unresolved_legal_evidence_D041_10', 'logic.coverage.all[1]', {'fact': 'at_fault_just_cause_ground_exists', 'op': EQ, 'value': True}, 'resolved', 'Tenant is at-fault. Failure to pay rent. Failure to fix or address a violation of the rental agreement. Creating a nuisance or causing damage to the rental unit.', 'Coverage hatte nur RSO-Status; at-fault-Grund fehlt. Kanonischer Fakt at_fault_just_cause_ground_exists existiert.')
D11 = add('D041-r011', 'unresolved_legal_evidence_D041_11', 'logic.coverage.all[1]', {'fact': 'eviction_is_no_fault', 'op': EQ, 'value': True}, 'resolved', 'Tenant is not at-fault. The owner or immediate family member will move into the rental unit. Demolition and permanent removal from the rental market. Government order. Conversion to affordable housing.', 'No-fault-Charakter fehlt in Coverage; kanonischer Fakt eviction_is_no_fault existiert (vgl. D041-r013/r014). Auf 300 Zeichen gekuerzt.')
D12 = add('D041-r013', 'unresolved_legal_evidence_D041_13', 'logic.coverage.all[1]', None, 'resolved', 'No-fault evictions require the payment of relocation assistance.', 'Redundant: LA + RSO + eviction_is_no_fault decken die Bedingung voll ab. Leaf streichen.')
